   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: N must be strictly closer to D than S is",
   "originalText": "The rule: N must be strictly closer to D than S is",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b04-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 432,
   "height": 23,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "downstream   ⇔   dist(N,D)  <  dist(S,D)",
   "originalText": "downstream   ⇔   dist(N,D)  <  dist(S,D)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b04-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Stronger than loop-free (B3): dist(S,D) ≤ dist(N,S) + dist(S,D), so downstream implies loop-free.\n•  Why it matters: if N is downstream of S, then S can’t be downstream of N. Two routers that both use\n   downstream alternates can never hand the traffic back and forth.\n•  Loop-free alone only promises that N won’t send it back while N uses its normal table. If N is\n   repairing too (E down for both), N’s backup may be S.",
   "originalText": "•  Stronger than loop-free (B3): dist(S,D) ≤ dist(N,S) + dist(S,D), so downstream implies loop-free.\n•  Why it matters: if N is downstream of S, then S can’t be downstream of N. Two routers that both use\n   downstream alternates can never hand the traffic back and forth.\n•  Loop-free alone only promises that N won’t send it back while N uses its normal table. If N is\n   repairing too (E down for both), N’s backup may be S.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b04-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 316,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Worked checks (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b04-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 350,
   "width": 622,
   "height": 140,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example      PLR → D   N    dist(N,D)  dist(PLR,D)  Loop-free  Downstream\n-----------  --------  ---  ---------  -----------  ---------  -----------\n6            S → D     N    2          2            ✓ 2 < 3    ✗ 2 = 2\n6            N → D     S    2          2            ✓ 2 < 3    ✗ 2 = 2\n6            N → D     M    10         2            ✓ 10 < 12  ✗\n1  square    S → D     N    10         20           ✓          ✓ 10 < 20\n§15 policy   S → D     A    2          11           ✓          ✓ 2 < 11\n§15 policy   S → D     B    11         11           ✓          ✗ 11 = 11",
   "originalText": "Example      PLR → D   N    dist(N,D)  dist(PLR,D)  Loop-free  Downstream\n-----------  --------  ---  ---------  -----------  ---------  -----------\n6            S → D     N    2          2            ✓ 2 < 3    ✗ 2 = 2\n6            N → D     S    2          2            ✓ 2 < 3    ✗ 2 = 2\n6            N → D     M    10         2            ✓ 10 < 12  ✗\n1  square    S → D     N    10         20           ✓          ✓ 10 < 20\n§15 policy   S → D     A    2          11           ✓          ✓ 2 < 11\n§15 policy   S → D     B    11         11           ✓          ✗ 11 = 11",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b04-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 500,
   "width": 501,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
