   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Simulated: fail router E, from S, LFA only (A9)",
   "originalText": "Simulated: fail router E, from S, LFA only (A9)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b04-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 534,
   "width": 656,
   "height": 88,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Policy                              S’s LFA  N’s LFA  Result for D\n----------------------------------  -------  -------  ------------------------\ndefault (prefer, prefer)            N        M        S → N → M → D, cost 21\nnode_protecting: ignore             N        S        loops S → N → S\ndownstream: require                 none     none     dropped at S",
   "originalText": "Policy                              S’s LFA  N’s LFA  Result for D\n----------------------------------  -------  -------  ------------------------\ndefault (prefer, prefer)            N        M        S → N → M → D, cost 21\nnode_protecting: ignore             N        S        loops S → N → S\ndownstream: require                 none     none     dropped at S",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b04-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 632,
   "width": 932,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 134623,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1780393,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The loop needs both to fail downstream: dist(S,D) = dist(N,D) = 2. A downstream rule would have rejected\nboth. Here it leaves no LFA, so S drops (or uses Remote LFA / TI-LFA if it runs them).",
   "originalText": "The loop needs both to fail downstream: dist(S,D) = dist(N,D) = 2. A downstream rule would have rejected\nboth. Here it leaves no LFA, so S drops (or uses Remote LFA / TI-LFA if it runs them).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
