   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 372193,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4922263,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 4, P4 → PE1 (primary via P2): P1 and P3 are\nboth node-protecting and both cost 50. P1 is downstream\n(10 < 20), P3 isn’t (20 = 20), so P1 wins.",
   "originalText": "Example 4, P4 → PE1 (primary via P2): P1 and P3 are\nboth node-protecting and both cost 50. P1 is downstream\n(10 < 20), P3 isn’t (20 = 20), so P1 wins.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
