   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §2, §8.1, §15  ·  docs/learn/04-lfa.md (Inequality 2)  ·  examples/06-link-protecting.yaml, 01-square.yaml, 04-isp-core.yaml  ·  checked with\ncomputeLfa(), simulateFailure()",
